  "body": "Found by the second review of PR #2668 (comment 7001940941). Each row is not a blocker.\n\n- [ ] B: a tool with a feed of zero, or a feed that is not a number, has no value to compare. Its Drill or Thread operation is skipped with no message. Add a \"not judged\" line.\n- [ ] C: `examples/catalog/2d/first-part/first-part.camproj` is saved at project version 71; the current version is 72. It also has fields from other work (`notes`, tool `number`). Save it again from `build.camscript` on the current main.\n- [ ] D: the helical Bore and Circular operations start with the old 1200 / 300 feeds and are not checked. The decision entry puts milling kinds out of scope. Decide if they get the check.\n- [ ] E: add tests for an inch program, for the tap exclusion, and for a Drill with a material-specific cutting-data row.\n- [ ] F: an edit that sets a feed above the tool feed gets no warning. The refusal comes only at the post. Add a warning to the `edit_operation` answer.\n",
